{100}{}{A Ranger.}
{200}{}{Head Security OFficer}
{210}{}{You see a man wearing a security outfit}
{1000}{}{Dialog options}
{1010}{}{neutral}
{2000}{}{Yeah. What do you need?}
{2010}{}{What is this place?}
{2020}{}{Who are you?}
{2030}{}{Can I get some cool guns and stuff?}
{2040}{}{Can I turn in supplies for Security to you?}
{2050}{}{I'm here for supplies Sir. }
{2060}{}{Uhm, I think I'll get going now}
{3000}{}{Get out of here. Don't waste my time.*looks at you with digust*
}
{4000}{}{No, we only sell our suppllies and equipment to Security}
{4010}{}{Hm, I see, I'd like to talk about something else.}
{4020}{}{Oh, okay I think I'll get going now.}
{5000}{}{*He hands you a list* The list says:
Stimpack - 3  
